# Size and speed

Stripped `tny` must stay **under 2.0 MiB** (stretch 1.0 MiB with dynamic TLS). Cold `--version` / `ask --help` under 5 ms; TUI first prompt under 10 ms with no spawn.

A new dependency is a budget change: update `docs/language-and-runtime.md` and `docs/size-and-speed.md` in the same change. Prefer system TLS and vendored .c files. Measure Release+strip, not debug.

```text
# ❌ BAD — static OpenSSL + libcurl + ncurses "just to get started"
# ✅ GOOD — yyjson + wslay + nanopb + ANSI, lazy backend load
```
